  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'BEDTIME ON THE FAST LANE

    Eight real truck-and-mattress platforms,
    three downhill races. Two loose pillows match each player color, shift and fall
    independently, and reset each race. Gravity supplies propulsion: there are no
    powered tires hidden under your mattress. Each valid finisher earns 8/7/6/5/4/3/2/1
    points. DNF earns zero. Total ties compare best finishing positions, then tied
    leaders race again. Exact simultaneous finishes share a place.


    LEAN WITH
    MOVEMENT

    Left/right shifts weight and carves the fabric slide; forward/back
    shifts fore/aft balance and pitch. Momentum keeps moving while you spin. HOLD
    ACTION to brace: less rotation/bounce, more drag. The same controls, gravity,
    contact and recovery apply to every human and AI.


    FOLLOW THE FLAGS

    Pass
    the eight checkpoint gates in order, then cross the finish. Seeded grass/mud,
    dips, ridges and small crests change the physical ride. Dodge exploding sheep,
    UTS runners, loose bins, barrels, cones, tires and rooted knockdown trees. Fallen
    trunks become nonblocking after six seconds. Everyone races the same generated
    course, and replays retain actual destruction poses. A sustained flip, fall or
    genuine stall returns you to the last passed safe checkpoint with a FIVE-SECOND
    stationary penalty; no forward skip. Three recoveries are available, then DNF.
    The generous100s race limit never invents a finisher. Ordinary slides and landings
    are not frozen.


    UP TO FOUR HUMANS

    Use independent keyboard clusters,
    controllers or exclusive shared sticks; AI fills eight. Names/colors and per-AI
    difficulty persist. Finished racers watch the active leader while every unfinished
    course and the shared weather continue. Pause/disconnect preserves the race.
    Reconnect/replacement requires neutral and fresh input. Actual-pose highlights
    offer angle/speed/rewind/skip and advance automatically for AI. Offline only.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -7304394381272760782, guid: 8e8f97682e668e94cb30d2e6b8e13d84,
    type: 2}
